  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "What could be more marvelous, more miraculous,\nthan multistrike moves?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re nimble!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500792019007200650020006E0069006D0062006C0065002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re stylish!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500792019007200650020007300740079006C006900730068002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They flow so elegantly!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065007900200066006C006F007700200073006F00200065006C006500670061006E0074006C0079002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not to mention that you get to make a bunch of\nhits in a row.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007400200074006F0020006D0065006E00740069006F006E0020007400680061007400200079006F0075002000670065007400200074006F0020006D0061006B006500200061002000620075006E006300680020006F0066000A006800690074007300200069006E0020006100200072006F0077002E00100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If every hit lands, think what a world of hurt your\nopponent will be in!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And if your opponent uses Protect, having a\nseries of staggered hits can let you get around it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plus, just think what multistrike moves can do if\nyou use an item to boost your critical-hit ratio...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And I’m just getting started!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000492019006D0020006A007500730074002000670065007400740069006E006700200073007400610072007400650064002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Um, can I interrupt?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006D002C002000630061006E0020004900200069006E0074006500720072007500700074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re still going?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00752019007200650020007300740069006C006C00200067006F0069006E0067003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, pardon me! I unleashed a multi-sentence\nmove.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhere are my manners? I should show you the\nwonder of multistrike moves...in battle!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please let me know when you’re ready to be\nmulti-struck with awe.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C00650061007300650020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F00770020007700680065006E00200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200074006F002000620065000A006D0075006C00740069002D00730074007200750063006B002000770069007400680020006100770065002E00100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ready to see if you can withstand my multistrike\nonslaught?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500610064007900200074006F002000730065006500200069006600200079006F0075002000630061006E00200077006900740068007300740061006E00640020006D00790020006D0075006C007400690073007400720069006B0065000A006F006E0073006C00610075006700680074003F00100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200072006500610064007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m not ready",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006E006F00740020007200650061006400790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quite understandable. Please do take the time to\nprepare well.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500690074006500200075006E006400650072007300740061006E006400610062006C0065002E00200050006C006500610073006500200064006F002000740061006B00650020007400680065002000740069006D006500200074006F000A0070007200650070006100720065002000770065006C006C002E00100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then prepare for an unrelenting—!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E0020007000720065007000610072006500200066006F007200200061006E00200075006E00720065006C0065006E00740069006E00672014002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Overwhelming—!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007600650072007700680065006C006D0069006E00672014002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Marvelous buffet of multistriking!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061007200760065006C006F0075007300200062007500660066006500740020006F00660020006D0075006C007400690073007400720069006B0069006E0067002100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Marvelous.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061007200760065006C006F00750073002E00100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You fought wonderfully. I’ve much to reflect on.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200066006F007500670068007400200077006F006E00640065007200660075006C006C0079002E002000492019007600650020006D00750063006800200074006F0020007200650066006C0065006300740020006F006E002E00100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "For example, not every blow in a multistrike move\nwill always land...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006F00720020006500780061006D0070006C0065002C0020006E006F007400200065007600650072007900200062006C006F007700200069006E002000610020006D0075006C007400690073007400720069006B00650020006D006F00760065000A00770069006C006C00200061006C00770061007900730020006C0061006E0064002E002E002E00100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "not to mention that while your Pokémon is using\na move, it’s wide open to being attacked...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Timing, positioning—there’s so much to consider!\nI need to battle more. Perhaps then I can see if—<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Um... Excuse me?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006D002E002E002E00200045007800630075007300650020006D0065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re still going?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00752019007200650020007300740069006C006C00200067006F0069006E0067003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, pardon me! I unleashed another multi-\nsentence move.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPlease, accept this TM with my apologies.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Triple Axel<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> is an Ice-type move in which the user\ndelivers three graceful jumping blows.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But that’s not all—each jump is higher than the\nlast and hits a wider radius too!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, the joy of landing each attack... The thrill of\nstrategizing around a sequence of strikes...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI hope you’ll join me in sharing the delight of\nmultistrike moves!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, the joy of landing each attack... The thrill of\nstrategizing around a sequence of strikes...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI hope you’ll join me in sharing the delight of\nmultistrike moves!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
